{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidLinkTypes","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidLinkTypes","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":26,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closure2_jones_at_one_sigma_sq_eq_neg_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closure2_jones_at_one_sigma_sq_eq_neg_two","kind":"theorem","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L182-L188","doc":"**Chain composition**: σ² in B_2 has Markov-closure-Jones-at-1 value -2.\nCloses by chaining `closure2_at_two_crossings_eq_hopf` and\n`jonesAtOne_hopf_eq_neg_two`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_doubleHopf_eq_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_doubleHopf_eq_four","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L173-L176","doc":"Double-Hopf (Hopf ⊔ Hopf) Jones value at `q = 1`: `(−2)² = 4`\n(disjoint-union multiplicativity). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_borromean_eq_neg_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_borromean_eq_neg_eight","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L167-L170","doc":"Borromean rings Jones value at `q = 1`: `−8`\n(3-component Brunnian link). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_trefoil_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_trefoil_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L160-L163","doc":"Trefoil knot `T(2,3)` Jones value at `q = 1`: `+1`\n(1-component, unnormalised). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_unknot_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_unknot_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L147-L149","doc":"Unknot Jones value at q=1: 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_hopf_eq_neg_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne_hopf_eq_neg_two","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L142-L145","doc":"**The classical Hopf-Jones value**: `jonesAtOne hopfLink = -2`.\nClosed by `rfl`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jonesAtOne","kind":"def","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L131-L139","doc":"Jones polynomial value at q = 1 for each link. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closure2_at_high_k","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closure2_at_high_k","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L108-L118","doc":"σ^k closes to the (2, k)-torus link for k ≥ 3 or k ≤ -3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closure2_at_one_eq_unknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closure2_at_one_eq_unknot","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L102-L106","doc":"For completeness: σ closes to the unknot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closure2_at_two_crossings_eq_hopf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closure2_at_two_crossings_eq_hopf","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L94-L100","doc":"**The atomic theorem**: the Markov closure of σ² in B_2 is the\nHopf link. Closed by `rfl` from the definition of `closure2`.\nDischarges Atom 1 of `rem:markov-closure-map-axiomatic`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.closure2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.closure2","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L75-L84","doc":"**Markov closure** of a 2-strand braid `n : ℤ` (= σ^n). At each\ncrossing count |n|, the closure is a torus-link T(2, n). The\nspecial case n = 2 gives the Hopf link. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2.σ_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2.σ_sq","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2.σ_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2.σ_inv","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2.σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2.σ","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L66-L69","doc":"Specific 2-strand braids. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Braid2","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L63-L64","doc":"The 2-strand braid group, encoded as ℤ (powers of σ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqLink.decEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqLink.decEq","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqLink","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqLink","kind":"instance","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprLink","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprLink","kind":"instance","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprLink.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprLink.repr","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Link.doubleHopf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Link.doubleHopf","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Link.borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Link.borromean","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Link.trefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Link.trefoil","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Link.torusLink2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Link.torusLink2","kind":"ctor","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Link.hopfLink","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Link.hopfLink","kind":"ctor","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Link.unknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Link.unknot","kind":"ctor","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Link","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Link","kind":"inductive","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidLinkTypes.lean#L42-L56","doc":"A small concrete inductive type for the links we need:\n`unknot` (single-component, trivial), `hopfLink` (2 components,\npairwise linking number 1), `torusLink2 k` (closure of σ_1^k in\nB_2), and three multi-link constructors used for the c_5/c_6\ncandidates: `trefoil` (= torusLink2 3, kept separate for\nJones-value clarity), `borromean` (3-component Brunnian link),\n`doubleHopf` (Hopf ⊔ Hopf, disjoint union). ","signatureChunk":0}]}